<title>JAPAN: Indonesia ups September Minas crude to $21.02/bbl.</title>
<headline>Indonesia ups September Minas crude to $21.02/bbl.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of Indonesia's main Minas crude oil for September lifting was calculated at $21.02 per barrel, up $1.53 from August, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Prices of other grades are as follows:</p>
<p>     TYPE	     SEPTEMBER	AUGUST</p>
<p> Ardjuna		  21.21	   19.68</p>
<p> Arun Condensate	21.04	   19.41</p>
<p> Attaka		   22.07	   20.21</p>
<p> Cinta		    20.43	   19.01</p>
<p> Duri		     19.46	   17.97</p>
<p> Handil		   20.90	   19.43</p>
<p> Lalang		   21.06	   19.52</p>
<p> Widuri		   20.35	   18.93</p>
<p> Belida		   22.04	   20.19</p>
<p> TYPE		    SEPTEMBER     AUGUST</p>
<p> Anoa		     22.47	   20.61</p>
<p> Badak		    22.07	   20.21</p>
<p> Bekapai		  22.07	   20.21</p>
<p> Bunyu		    20.72	   19.19</p>
<p> Jatibarang	     20.01	   18.48</p>
<p> Bontang Mix	    20.84	   19.21</p>
<p> Walio		    20.82	   19.29</p>
</text>
